  "body_html": "<h1>Optimal Strategy Sets</h1>\n<p>For a matrix game $A$, let $X(A)$ be the subset of $\\Delta(I)$ consisting of\noptimal strategies of player 1, and let $Y(A)$ be the subset of $\\Delta(J)$\nconsisting of optimal strategies of player 2.</p>",
